                                "sense_id": "7f6f8815-5a71-3907-9f4b-9c01e9a22920",
                                "text": "From melancholy aduſt ariſes one kind [of humour]; from Choler another, which is moſt brutiſh: another from Flegme, which is dull; and the laſt from Blood, which is beſt."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "883aa9cf-6ca8-49c8-b654-e88133d4b390",
                                "sense_id": "7f6f8815-5a71-3907-9f4b-9c01e9a22920",
                                "text": "[S]o in fevers and hot diſtempers from choler aduſt is cauſed a blackneſſe in our tongues, teeth and excretions: […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
